<Base lang="en" route="about" title="About Veintiuno and How Our Charts Are Built" description="Veintiuno is an educational blackjack app made by independent developer Iván Sevilla. How our strategy charts are computed, which sources we use, and why we never promote casinos.">
  <div class="container legal">
